<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Settings has three panes: General, Bar, and Pinned. The window fits each pane and is named after it.</li>
    <li>The Accessibility permission is one row that shows its state or a Grant Access button, and it updates when you come back from System Settings.</li>
    <li>The display list appears only with more than one display, and the shortcut's Reset button only after you change the shortcut.</li>
    <li>About DockishOS is the standard About panel, in the status menu.</li></ul>
<p class="footer">DockishOS 0.030</p>
